{
  "text": "7th Hadith On the authority of Abu Ruqayya Tamim ibn Aus ad-Dari, may Allah be pleased of him, that the Prophet, may the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, said, Religion is sincerity. We said, To whom? He said, To Allah and His Book, and His Messenger, and to the leaders of the Muslims and their common folk. It was related by Muslim.",
